UnlockCallbackTest
├── given deployTokenId is 0
│ └── it does not collect fees and proceeds to swapAndAdd
└── given deployTokenId is non-zero
    ├── when position liquidity is 0
    │ └── it skips the fee-collect decrease
    ├── when position liquidity is non-zero
    │ └── it collects fees into the budget
    └── when budget0 is 0 AND budget1 is 0 AND route is empty
        └── it reverts with {NoFeesToCompound}
